<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Your OTP for Verification</title>
    <style>
        /* Global Styles */
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #6a1b9a, #8e24aa, #ab47bc);
            /* Gradient purple background */
            background-size: cover;
            height: 100vh;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .email-container {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            color: #333333;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #333333;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        p {
            color: #333333;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .otp-container {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 18px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #6a1b9a;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .footer-text {
            color: #333333;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .footer-text p {
            margin: 5px 0;
        }

        .btn {
            background-color: #6a1b9a;
            /* Deep purple color for the button */
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #8e24aa;
            /* Lighter purple on hover */
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <table role="presentation">
        <tr>
            <td>
                <div class="email-container">
                    <h2>OTP Verification</h2>
                    <p>We have received a request to verify your account. Please use the following OTP to complete the
                        process:</p>

                    <div class="otp-container">
                        OTP: <span>{{otp}}</span>
                    </div>

                    <p>This OTP is valid for the next 1 minute. If you did not request this, please ignore this email.
                    </p>

                    <p>If you need assistance, feel free to reach out to us.</p>

                    {{!-- <a href="https://yourportal.com/verify" class="btn">Verify Your Account</a> --}}

                    <div class="footer-text">
                        <p>Best regards,</p>
                        <p>The Job Junction Team</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>

</html>